 Subject\">Health Sciences</a>, <a href=\"https://guides.library.ucla.edu/math-guides\" aria-label=\"Mathematics &amp; Statistics Subject\">Mathematics & Statistics</a>, <a href=\"https://guides.library.ucla.edu/physics-guides\" aria-label=\"Physics &amp; Astronomy Subject\">Physics & Astronomy</a>\n            </div>\n</div>\n<!-- !bs3/box/profile_box_content.twig -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div></div>","blog_posts":"<div class=\"pull-left\"><h2 class=\"muted\">No blog posts have been assigned to this subject.</h2></div>","er_courses":"","rows":1},"version":"x.x"}